Z||000000||batboy||10-02-1999||11:36 AM||||I was amazed at all the knowledgeable electronics people we have on the forum, especially in that sequential taillight thread. Maybe one of you bright people can design a cheap and easy headlight reminder. You know, a buzzer to tell you your lights are on after you turn the ignition off. It's pretty obvious when the headlights are up, but I left the parking lights on and walked into work the other day. Fortunately, a co-worker spotted my lights being on immediately and told me before the battery ran down. I use the parking lights a lot in fog or rain, I hope it makes my little Fiero more visible to others. Thanks!||||reg||1
