Z||000027||batboy||10-04-1999||01:47 AM||||LOwCG, there are horns in the nose in front of each tire. Jack up the car a little, get down at ground level near the tire and look up and forward, they're tucked up in there half hidden. One wire goes to each horn and the horns themself are grounded to the frame.||||reg||1
