Z||000040||Standard||10-06-1999||02:28 AM||||What a wonderful group of "blue dingy thingy" experts!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>David, that eight-blade spot is exactly where the buzzer goes.  Head to a junkyard and look for a blue box in the same place on a few fieros.  Don't know if one's from other cars would work, but I'd guess that they're pretty standardized.. no pun intended.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <P>Racer 1, every car should have one, but sometimes people pull them out because the get annoying.  It's the "audio alarm assembly", I believe.<P>Batboy, I've seen some sites on the net that had instructions on how to remove certain alarms so you could disable the door buzzer and key buzzer and leave the light chime.  Can't seem to recall where I found those, tho.  I see if I can find anything.<BR>Later All.||||reg||10
