Z||000046||SCCA FIERO||10-06-1999||10:26 PM||||There is a way to <B>Modify</B> the <B>"Blue Dingy Thingy"</B> to only <B>"Bing"</B> about certain things. There are several capacitor <B>thingymabobs</B> inside the <B>bluethingamajig</B> that can be cut to disable certain <B>"Bings"</B>. All these technical terms has made me feel like some kinda smart type guy  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  If anyone wants to know which ones to cut to disable the different Bings, let me know and I will dig it up.||||reg||6
